{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"e2d649f6-10cc-41e8-9c30-7d1a650f4cc6","title":"Best use of Meteora's Dynamic Bonding Curve (DBC)","slug":"meteora-dbc","description":"\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMeteora’s stack is built for builders wanting to innovate on asset creation.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMeteora's Dynamic Bonding Curve (DBC) is a fully configurable token launch primitive: you control the curve shape, fee schedule, quote token, graduation threshold, and how the pool migrates into Meteora DAMM v2 liquidity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eGoals\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eWe believe that there is a lot left to tokenize hence we need more innovative launchpads. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMeteora’s tech enables you build a launchpad that does stock-pairs, icm-pairs, meme-pairs, rwa-pairs and fully custom pair setups i.e. more asset classes on the same liquidity layer. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur focus is on builders who want to experiment on ideas related to \u003cstrong\u003eRWAs, Tokenized Stocks, AI, Memes \u003c/strong\u003eetc. that's built on Meteora DBC and DAMM v2 tech.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eIdeas we’d love to see\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLaunch Mechanics tuned for Equity / Stocks paired launches\u003c/strong\u003e: price discovery for thinly traded or newly tokenized names (xStocks, Backpack Onchain, Ondo RFQ, and the rest of the catalog).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNovel Curve or Fee Configurations\u003c/strong\u003e for a DBC token launch. For example. Flat Curve, Exponential Curve or Long Curve.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCreative end-to-end launch flows\u003c/strong\u003e using all of our stack (DBC, DAMM v2 and DLMM). For example, Conviction Pools with DLMM or Compounding Liquidity DAMM v2 Pools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eData Streams or Developer Tooling\u003c/strong\u003e for trading terminals and builders to easily plug-and-play when building a launchpad.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDBC Config Preset Marketplace\u003c/strong\u003e - Popular launchpad configs that builders can easily pay-to-use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDepth of Meteora integration\u003c/strong\u003e: How central and meaningful is the use of the Meteora stack?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical execution\u003c/strong\u003e: Code quality, architecture decisions, and robustness of the implementation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOriginality and Taste\u003c/strong\u003e: Does the project explore a new use case of DBC and would last beyond the current meme-stock meta\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImpact potential\u003c/strong\u003e: Could this scale and create a new class of assets?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTraction/Volume\u003c/strong\u003e: We prefer projects who have gone live on mainnet and have people actively using their product\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: \u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eFor projects that are close-sourced, please add Github ID \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://github.com/dannxbt\"\u003e\u003cem\u003edannxbt\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e in with Read permissions for Judging.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003eResources and Tools\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDBC developer guide \u003c/strong\u003e— \u003ca target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://docs.meteora.ag/developer-guides/dbc\"\u003edocs.meteora.ag/developer-guides/dbc\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDAMM v2 developer guide\u003c/strong\u003e — \u003ca target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://docs.meteora.ag/developer-guides/damm-v2\"\u003edocs.meteora.ag/developer-guides/damm-v2\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDBC program\u003c/strong\u003e — \u003ca target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://github.com/MeteoraAg/dynamic-bonding-curve\"\u003egithub.com/MeteoraAg/dynamic-bonding-curve\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDAMM v2 program\u003c/strong\u003e — \u003ca target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://github.com/MeteoraAg/damm-v2\"\u003egithub.com/MeteoraAg/damm-v2\u003c/a\u003e \u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInvent CLI\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eActions — \u003ca target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://docs.meteora.ag/invent/actions\"\u003edocs.meteora.ag/invent/actions\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eRep